//? Title: Summed-area tables: actual prefix cells and four-lookup rectangles
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
An integral image pays one grid build to answer inclusive rectangle sums with
four prefix reads. We retain the original6 by6 grid and expose actual recurrence
operands and query corners.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

With a zero border, S(r+1,c+1)=A(r,c)+S(r,c+1)+S(r+1,c)-S(r,c). An inclusive
rectangle is S(r1+1,c1+1)-S(r0,c1+1)-S(r1+1,c0)+S(r0,c0). Construction is linear
in grid cells; a checked rectangle query performs exactly four prefix lookups
regardless of area. In double, cancellation/rounding can differ from direct
summation, so exact equality is asserted only for the small integer fixture, not
arbitrary high-dynamic-range data.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/summed_area_table_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/random/quality.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/summed_area_table.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    a::SummedAreaTable r({{1, 2}, {3, 4}}, {.capture = true});
    std::print("| actual row,col | input | above | left | diagonal | output prefix |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | " "---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.steps())
        std::print("| {},{} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", s.row, s.col,
                   s.input, s.above, s.left, s.diagonal, s.value);
    auto q = r.query(0, 0, 1, 1);
    std::print("Actual query corners {},{},{},{}; sum {}; lookups {}.\n",
               q.bottom_right, q.above, q.left, q.diagonal, q.value, q.lookups);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Actual input1,2 /3,4");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual prefix transitions",
                                     r.steps().size()));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Four actual reads; sum {}", q.value));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/summed_area_table_tiny.svg");
}
```
