| 2 | 4 | 4 | 18 |
| 3 | 9 | 4 | 72 |
| 4 | 16 | 4 | 184 |
| 5 | 25 | 4 | 375 |
| 6 | 36 | 4 | 666 |
Reversed inclusive rectangle rejected.
\image(figures/summed_area_table_controls.svg)
